# RDoc's default visibility is `:protected` (`RDoc::Options#visibility`),
# so it documents a library's protected methods, and a subclass outside
# the repo may call them; trekr graded them as private, `clear`. A
# protected method is public API as a public one is, under the same marks;
# a private one still is not, and after `module_function` a bare
# `protected` leaves an instance method that is API (DEC-657).
